line	
line	<str>Go to the eastern room.</str>
line	
line	<str>With a needle, thread, and leather, fix the bellows.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the lever by the bellows.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the middle room and search the boxes in the north-east to get a stone bowl.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the south room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a stone bowl on the lava trough to the south.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the bowl of lava on the Furnace in the room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the western room and mine an elemental rock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the Earth elemental and pick up the elemental ore it drops (get 2 more ores if you are planning to do Elemental Workshop II).</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the elemental ore and four coal on the furnace in the southern room. You will get an Elemental metal.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>With the <col=800000>slashed book</col>, go to the middle room and smith an <col=800000>elemental shield</col> by using the <col=800000>elemental metal</col> on the workbench.</col>
done	<str>In Seers' Village, go to the house immediately south of the anvil.</str>
done	
done	<str>Search the bookcase on the eastern wall to find a battered book.</str>
done	
done	<str>Read the book, then use a knife on it to get a Battered key.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go to the building with anvil and open the Odd looking wall in the north (with the key in inventory).</str>
done	
done	<str>Go down the stairs.</str>
done	
done	<str>Go into the room to the north.</str>
done	
done	<str>Turn the water controls east of the water wheel.</str>
done	
done	<str>Turn the water controls west of the water wheel.</str>
done	
done	<str>Pull the lever by the water wheel.</str>
done	
done	<str>(Optional) Kill one of each of the Elemental to complete Kandarin Easy Task. For the Earth Elemental, you must defeat one of the actual Elementals walking around; the rock that turns into the Elemental won't count towards the requirement.</str>
